# `Dog extends Animal` across SEPARATE packages (separate Wasm modules, linked).
# `@test/dogs` reconstructs the imported `Animal` rec group and lays `Dog` out as
# a subtype of it; the root script links both and exercises construction,
# inherited + overridden dispatch, `super(...)`, fields, and `instanceof`.
# name           dir       deps                       root
@test/animals    animals   -
@test/dogs       dogs      @test/animals
main             app       @test/animals,@test/dogs   root
